        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_138#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "text": "Craft to surpass Nature.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_138#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "However... most regretfully, if I'd ever seen such an unusual item as this before, I'd certainly\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_140#2",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir, the feast is prepared.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Villager"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_138#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good, good. May I ask you all if you've found anywhere to stay in the village?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not for the time being...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_138#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've arrived as guests. It'd be best if you rested here for some days, and once the Dusk Ridding has passed, you hurry on your way again!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Storyteller"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 30,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Quietly) Benefactor, your verdict?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -30,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "(Quietly) It's not like we've got anywhere to go... We may as well stay in the village for now and gather intel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Quietly) This place obviously doesn't match up with the 'Yan' we know. Not to mention, we still have no indication of how we got here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 20,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Right!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "In that case, we'd be best to accept.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_indoor",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "So in the end, we still don't have a literal clue... Eh, but the tea here smells great. Is this how the green tea is in Yan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Kroos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, I've got my manners.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 20,
        "times": 1,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I could drink this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've put out fruits here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, are you testing for poison, benefactors? You should've said sooner; let me come to your aid!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 20,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmph!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "left",
        "type": "jump",
        "power": 20,
        "times": 2,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mm, dear benefactor, this fruit is quite fresh! And peculiarly sweet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#4",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't mean...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mind it not! As the proverb goes, one cannot lack the heart to protect, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I wasn't worried if they poisoned anything... I was just checking through... everything in our perimeter.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're pretty fidgety right now, aren't you? No problem, we're all the same. Lost in the fog.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's like we're checking if we're even still alive.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Checking again, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You chill here. I still need to take another look outside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I leave my benefactor to toil alone! I must accompany you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then let's split up and move. The way things are, none of us is gonna sit still.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright. Then shall we meet in... two hours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you think we can trust him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if it's not rare to see poor bastards in a tight spot on the wastes, coincidences like his are the last thing you can trust.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I think so too. And it's a fact that he's been deceiving us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gloompincers that leave their nests are highly aggressive. And when we found him, he was up in a tree looking all sad... but he was about 800 whole meters away from the car crash.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "text": "And just seeing his actions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if he's got no ill will, we've still gotta be wary of each other.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll keep an eye on him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
