    },
    {
        "text": "*Sigh*.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "(I may have been drawn into something indescribably bizarre... But I suppose that has had a silver lining...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Speaking of which, this truly isn't\u2014any joking matter... If I can't find a way to return, then what do I even do...)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Oh... but Lava and Kroos have been quite the saviors to me. I can't fault them for this... *sigh*! I'll just have to see as I go\u2014)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
