    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ohh, my apologies there, I'm truly sorry. I was lost in thought and clearly wasn't watching my way\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ah!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "text": "By your appearance, surely you are from outside, are you not? It has been so long since I saw a visitor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Saga, humble servant of the Buddha, a wandering monk from Higashi! May I ask from whence thou comest?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
